content.text:
Now styles.css. This is big. Let's write it in parts too, to avoid output limit. Part 1: @import, root tweaks, game layout, topbar, identity, stats, feed, age dock, bottom nav, subpage shell, panels, activities, relationships. Part 2: career, assets, more, sheets/modals, drawer, death, animations/responsive.

Let me write carefully. Use CSS that matches all class names.

Base styles already define .app, .screen, .btn, .card, etc. We add.

Start:

```css
@import url("css/base.css");

:root { --nav-h: 62px; ...}
```

Actually @import must precede all other rules except @charset. Fine.

Game layout:
```css
.game { background: var(--bg); }
.game-main { position: relative; flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
```
Topbar.

Important: `.screen` position absolute inset 0; `.game` display flex column via base. `.game-main` flex 1. bottomnav after age dock; age dock absolute within game. Since bottomnav is after age dock in DOM but age dock absolute, fine.

Topbar:
```css
.topbar { flex:0 0 auto; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; height:calc(56px + var(--safe-top)); padding: var(--safe-top) 10px 0; background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ff4a38,#e5231b); color:#fff; box-shadow:...; z-index:10; }
```
topbar-btn 40x40.

Topbar-title flex 1 min-width 0 text-align center; strong block 15px 900; span 10.5.

topbar-money pill.

Identity:
```css
.identity { flex:0 0 auto; padding:10px 12px 0; }
.identity-card { display:flex; gap:11px; align-items:center; background:#fff; border-radius:18px; padding:11px 12px; box-shadow:...; }
.id-avatar { width:64; height:64; flex:0 0 64; border-radius:50%; overflow:hidden; ...}
.id-main flex 1 min-width 0
.id-name 16.5 900 color blue; white-space nowrap ellipsis
