Title tweaks:
- title wordmark maybe two lines. Base `.title-wordmark` nowrap; br works. Font 43; with br two lines height ~80. Could be fine but title-logo with mark 46. Add `line-height:.82; font-size:38px;` maybe. But base is fine. Need `@keyframes bob` because base uses it. Add.

Create tweaks:
- `.create-screen .create-scroll` maybe. Base covers. Need `.create-hero` etc. Good.
- swatches might overflow; base `.swatches` flex wrap. Good.

Overlays:
```css
.overlay-root { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 90; pointer-events: none; }
.overlay-root:empty { display: none; }
.overlay { position: fixed; inset:0; z-index:90; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background: rgba(6,16,21,.55); backdrop-filter: blur(3px); pointer-events:auto; animation: fadeIn .18s ease; }
#sheet-root .overlay { align-items:flex-end; }
#drawer-root .overlay { justify-content:flex-start; }
```
Since overlay roots have z-index but children fixed. Fine.

Sheet:
```css
.sheet { width:100%; max-width:440px; max-height:88dvh; background:#fff; border-radius:22px 22px 0 0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; overflow:hidden; padding-bottom: var(--safe-bottom); animation: sheetUp .24s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1); }
.sheet-grip { width:38px;height:4px;border-radius:99;background:#dbe4e8;margin:8px auto 0; flex:none;}
.sheet-head { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; padding:10px 16px 8px; flex:none; }
