.sheet-head span { display:block; font-size:10.5; font-weight:700; color:muted; margin-top:2px;}
.sheet-close { width:34;height:34;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#eef4f6;color:#61717b;}
.sheet-body { flex:1; min-height:0; overflow-y:auto; padding:4px 16px 18px; }
```
For sheet-body `.scroll` base has overflow; fine.

Amount:
```css
.amount-wrap { padding-top:6px; }
.amount-input { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:#f7fafb; border:1.5px solid #d6e1e6; border-radius:14px; padding:0 12px; height:56px; }
.amount-input span { font-size:18px; font-weight:900; color:var(--muted); }
