```

Person:
```css
.person-hero { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; padding:4px 0 14px; }
.person-avatar { width:92;height:92;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;background:#e8f2f4;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px #fff,0 0 0 5.5px #d7e7ea; }
