```

Action grid:
```css
.action-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:7px; }
.action-btn { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:1px; padding:9px 10px; border-radius:13px; background:#f7fafb; border:1px solid #e4ecef; text-align:left; min-height:62px; }
