```

Assets:
```css
.worth-card { background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0d6b7a,#063f49); border-radius:20px; padding:14px 15px; margin-bottom:12px; color:#fff; box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(6,63,73,.24); }
